        },
        {
          "text": "man ekabu piny m’akana woko kud i ot pa Yehova, ku piny m’akana mi ot p’ubimo; ekabu woko ceke: man ekabu ban ceke mi mola ma kwar woko ma Suleman utimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
