          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Rehoboam unindo ku kwaru mire, e juyike ku kwaru mire i adhura pa Daudi: man nying’ min mire Nama ma Nyaamoni. E Abijam ma wode camu ker kakare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.31",
